WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:02.844
Start with the organizer submitting a fictional request.

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.155
The form sends the fields to a service.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:08.557
The service checks required information and either rejects

00:00:08.603 --> 00:00:11.494
it with a useful explanation or saves one record.

00:00:11.935 --> 00:00:14.767
The owner then opens the private list and marks that

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:15.557
record handled.

00:00:15.998 --> 00:00:17.624
Draw arrows for these moves.

00:00:17.798 --> 00:00:20.990
Identify the source of truth: the authoritative record

00:00:21.025 --> 00:00:22.569
that determines current status.

00:00:23.011 --> 00:00:26.610
If a copy or summary exists elsewhere, say how it stays

00:00:26.668 --> 00:00:28.212
consistent with that record.
